        "subject": "LU-21051 ssk: grant user permissions on SSK keys",
        "message": "LU-21051 ssk: grant user permissions on SSK keys\n\nSSK keys are owned by root, and every consumer of them runs as root,\nso user permissions are therefore sufficient.\nMake the test scripts set the same permissions on SSK keys. And update\nsanity-sec test_200 accordingly.\n\nFixes: f26503384099 (\"LU-14479 ssk: explicitly set perm on key\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity\nTest-Parameters: testgroup=review-dne-selinux-ssk-part-1\nTest-Parameters: testgroup=review-dne-selinux-ssk-part-2\nTest-Parameters: kerberos=true testlist=sanity-krb5\nSigned-off-by: Sebastien Buisson <sbuisson@ddn.com>\nAssisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5\nChange-Id: I38e34b5a410cd20dbfd4668d94dbf6638e26a715\n"
